  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_3c3bf0f9a88846cfbf767a197f7b6a9c",
      "statement": "The agt CLI communicates with the controller REST API and is built with Cobra. It registers 11 top-level subcommands: apply, create, get, update, delete, worker, status, version, llm-preflight, rotate, and manager-state.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agentteams-controller/cmd/agt/main.go#L17-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:558b69eb70183073eac68e2b960482238976aaf5736c1ee1d879eeb4294042f5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f7b4b51da3d2492892fbfbc53c5f6bf6",
      "statement": "The CLI authenticates via bearer token discovered in order: AGENTTEAMS_AUTH_TOKEN env var, AGENTTEAMS_AUTH_TOKEN_FILE file path, or unauthenticated fallback. The default controller URL is http://localhost:8090.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agentteams-controller/cmd/agt/client.go#L33-L65",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:92ebd8824184f68afc9c80e364a2b2523dc35844ee2ab0c5e911a09d9cc8ed87:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5352006bd1cc445098a63ffbbe986292",
      "statement": "The worker lifecycle subcommands (wake, sleep, ensure-ready, status, report-ready) all accept --name and optionally --team flags. The report-ready subcommand also reads the worker name from AGENTTEAMS_WORKER_CR_NAME or AGENTTEAMS_WORKER_NAME env vars and supports --heartbeat with configurable --interval (default 60s).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agentteams-controller/cmd/agt/worker_cmd.go#L11-L291",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1249e40bc5ea8816eee3451727ca05d63059f01083703ab70ed51166fd27c925:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_258c8f56963b476592208b08430591ce",
      "statement": "The REST API is registered in http.go with Go 1.22+ method-pattern routing. It registers routes for resource CRUD (workers, teams, humans, managers, projects), lifecycle (wake/sleep/ensure-ready/ready/status), message injection, gateway consumer/provider management, credentials (STS and Matrix token), package upload, status/version/healthz, AppService management, manager-tasks passthrough, Docker proxy (embedded mode), and Matrix AppService event push.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agentteams-controller/internal/server/http.go#L47-L167",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:04fe88a18251fc56b1a6342e697824068c011ddf1269673be8c633f851ac2bfa:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1bd348be243640ee867e7801f3d149ee",
      "statement": "GET /api/v1/workers returns an aggregated view that includes both standalone Worker CRs and synthesized WorkerResponse entries for every member of every Team, enriched with live backend status. The list supports a ?team= query parameter filter.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agentteams-controller/internal/server/resource_handler.go#L190-L250",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:36b0dea606b0be79025538035b4eb9b7111aeef309854119cbcf124282ef2d56:"
