    {
      "id": "claim_e1f7da536b3447278d5c2eb0327ecf09",
      "statement": "Lifecycle handlers (wake, sleep, ensure-ready) set spec.State declaratively to trigger the reconciler AND directly operate the backend for immediate response. If the direct backend operation fails, the reconciler retries.",
