    {
      "id": "claim_89fe598f95914a348b8fcd8cd634f7f2",
      "statement": "The Ready endpoint (POST /api/v1/workers/{name}/ready) is the worker's self-report mechanism. It stores readiness in an in-memory map. The GetWorkerRuntimeStatus endpoint promotes phase to Ready when the backend reports running AND the worker has self-reported ready.",
