      "statement": "The create worker CLI command validates the worker name, expands package URIs, supports --soul-file for inline SOUL.md content, --skills as comma-separated list, --expose for port forwarding, --team/--role for team assignment, and --wait-timeout (default 3m) with --no-wait to skip ready polling.",
